{"id":"fb687bda8415ad17","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-gl-tableau-termination.md","title":"Termination and Depth Bound for GL Tableaux","display":"lem-gl-tableau-termination — Termination and Depth Bound for GL Tableaux","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-gl-tableau-termination","aliases":["89-lem-gl-tableau-termination"],"display":"lem-gl-tableau-termination — Termination and Depth Bound for GL Tableaux","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-tableau-procedure]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-gl-tableau-termination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-gl-tableau-termination</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-gl-tableau-termination — Termination and Depth Bound for GL Tableaux"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"59e94f1adddc4fdd\" href=\"?note=59e94f1adddc4fdd\" title=\"89-df-gl-tableau-procedure\">89-df-gl-tableau-procedure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_k=T_A^k\">\\(T_k=T_A^k\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"59e94f1adddc4fdd\" href=\"?note=59e94f1adddc4fdd\" title=\"89-df-gl-tableau-procedure\">89-df-gl-tableau-procedure</a> 定义的全迭代序列，饱和后保持原值。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Child}_T\">\\(\\mathsf{Child}_T\\)</span> 使用该定义的分支出现关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_b\">\\(\\Gamma_b\\)</span> 为分支记录的公式序列。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(A),n(A),P(b)\">\\(\\mathcal B(A),n(A),P(b)\\)</span> 在下面定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}termination}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal B(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)\\mid\\exists C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ D=\\Box C\\},\\quad\nn(A)\\coloneqq|\\mathcal B(A)|,\\\\\nP(b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma_b)\\cap\\mathcal B(A),\\\\\n&amp;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\ \\bigl[\\mathsf{SatTab}(T_N)\\land\n\\forall r\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\vec a\\in\\mathsf{Br}(T_N)^{r+1}\\\n\\bigl((\\forall i\\le r\\ \\mathsf{Open}(T_N|a_i))\\land\n\\forall i&lt;r\\ ((a_i,a_{i+1})\\in\\mathsf{Child}_{T_N})\\to r\\le n(A)\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}termination}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal B(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)\\mid\\exists C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ D=\\Box C\\},\\quad\nn(A)\\coloneqq|\\mathcal B(A)|,\\\\\nP(b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma_b)\\cap\\mathcal B(A),\\\\\n&amp;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\ \\bigl[\\mathsf{SatTab}(T_N)\\land\n\\forall r\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\vec a\\in\\mathsf{Br}(T_N)^{r+1}\\\n\\bigl((\\forall i\\le r\\ \\mathsf{Open}(T_N|a_i))\\land\n\\forall i&lt;r\\ ((a_i,a_{i+1})\\in\\mathsf{Child}_{T_N})\\to r\\le n(A)\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 10 章 pp.142–143、146。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>父分支含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\Box C\">\\(\\neg\\Box C\\)</span> 时，若也含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box C\">\\(\\Box C\\)</span>，它已闭合，故在允许展开的父分支中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box C\\notin P(b)\">\\(\\Box C\\notin P(b)\\)</span>。由模态规则的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PReady}\">\\(\\mathsf{PReady}\\)</span> 守卫，父分支在建窗口前已完成命题展开，之后其公式列不再增加。新窗口保留父分支的最终全部正盒并加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box C\">\\(\\Box C\\)</span>，所以在最终开放父子链上每下降一级，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|P(b)|\">\\(|P(b)|\\)</span> 至少增加 1；正盒只能来自有限的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(A)\">\\(\\mathcal B(A)\\)</span>，于是链长至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n(A)\">\\(n(A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>一个局部命题展开把当前发生项替换为真子公式的新发生项；每个发生项只检查一次。因此每个局部命题阶段有限。每条有限分支仅有有限多负盒发生项，每项只创建一个窗口；配合深度界，所有窗口与分叉合计仍有限，程序终止。</p>\n<p>闭窗口出现后保留的历史记录可能更深，本条深度界只约束开放链；开放反模型的关系高度因此至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n(A)\">\\(n(A)\\)</span>。它不是对所有任意手绘真值树的无条件界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-tableau-procedure","status":"resolved","id":"59e94f1adddc4fdd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-tableau-procedure]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-tableau-procedure","status":"resolved","id":"59e94f1adddc4fdd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$；$T_k=T_A^k$ 是 [[89-df-gl-tableau-procedure]] 定义的全迭代序列，饱和后保持原值。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"T_k=T_A^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Child}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(A),n(A),P(b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}termination}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal B(A)&\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)\\mid\\exists C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ D=\\Box C\\},\\quad\nn(A)\\coloneqq|\\mathcal B(A)|,\\\\\nP(b)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma_b)\\cap\\mathcal B(A),\\\\\n&\\exists N\\in\\omega\\ \\bigl[\\mathsf{SatTab}(T_N)\\land\n\\forall r\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\vec a\\in\\mathsf{Br}(T_N)^{r+1}\\\n\\bigl((\\forall i\\le r\\ \\mathsf{Open}(T_N|a_i))\\land\n\\forall i<r\\ ((a_i,a_{i+1})\\in\\mathsf{Child}_{T_N})\\to r\\le n(A)\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\Box C","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box C","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box C\\notin P(b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PReady}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box C","display":false},{"tex":"|P(b)|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(A)","display":false},{"tex":"n(A)","display":false},{"tex":"n(A)","display":false}],"bytes":2366,"backlinks":[{"id":"84ff5236d2f50db8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c6c452d9588f09ff","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$；$T_A^k$ 是已定义的确定真值树序列，终止性由 [[89-lem-gl-tableau-termination]] 保证。"},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-88","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-tableau-termination]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-147","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-tableau]] → [[89-df-gl-tableau-characteristic]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-window]] → [[89-df-gl-tableau-procedure]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-termination]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-closed-soundness]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel]] → [[89-thm-gl-tableau-decision]]"}],"outgoing":["59e94f1adddc4fdd"]}